=== task: order medium
title: One pass of the loop
prompt: Put the four lines of one pass of the reverse loop in order.
items:
- `nxt = cur.next`, to save the rest of the list
- `cur.next = prev`, to flip the link
- `prev = cur`, so the reversed part starts at `cur`
- `cur = nxt`, to move on to the rest
hint: The flip overwrites the link to the rest, so the rest has to be saved first.
hint: `prev` has to move before `cur` does, because `prev` takes `cur`'s old value.
